OL,3,GNEWSARiver turbine broken for years,
OL,4,Acouncil admits
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hydropower generator, which was once
OL,7,Fchampioned as a demonstration of a
OL,8,Flocal authority's "commitment to
OL,9,Frenewable energy", has been broken
OL,10,Fsince 2023 and it remains unclear when
OL,11,Fit will be fixed.
OL,13,FThe water turbine was installed on the
OL,14,FRiver Wear in Durham in 2014 amid
OL,15,Fboasts about its ability to generate
OL,16,Fthe equivalent amount of electricity
OL,17,Ftypically used by 113 homes each year.
OL,19,FBut Durham County Council has now
OL,20,Fadmitted the generator has not worked
OL,21,Fsince 2023 due to a "major gearbox
OL,22,Ffailure".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
