OL,4,Acouncil admits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority's interim corporate
OL,7,Fbuilding head Kevin Lough said the
OL,8,Fcouncil was seeking to repair the
OL,9,Fmachinery, but it was a complex task
OL,10,Fwhich required dive teams.
